Lakṣmaṇa looses hissing shaft as bowstring pales Indrajit --- Vibhīṣaṇa sees dejection and urges haste as foe broken --- Lakṣmaṇa looses flame shafts stunning foe senseless briefly --- Recovered Indrajit recalls first battle binding brothers senseless --- Indrajit pierces Lakṣmaṇa Hanumān and Vibhīṣaṇa with hundreds --- Laughing Lakṣmaṇa scorns light shafts and showers arrow rain --- Lakṣmaṇa shatters gold armor leaving foe wounded like peaked mountain --- Both panting bloodied display weapons binding sky with arrows --- Arrow mound rises like kuśa between fires as bodies shine flowered --- Neither tires in long clash as Vibhīṣaṇa advances to relieve Lakṣmaṇa
